5. VIRTUAL-AVIATION USE ONLY

USAFCACARS is designed exclusively for virtual aviation, entertainment,
education, software testing, and flight simulation.

The Software is not certified, approved, or intended for:

- Real-world flight planning or dispatch;
- Real-world air traffic control;
- Aircraft navigation;
- Aircraft maintenance;
- Operational weather decision-making;
- Emergency response;
- Safety-critical systems; or
- The control of any real aircraft, vehicle, or equipment.

Any aircraft controls, instruments, ATC tools, maps, charts, weather,
communications, passenger systems, or operational displays within the
Software are simulation features only.

